{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1787","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Colorful Tree Again"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An edge-weighted tree of $$$n$$$ nodes is given with each edge colored in some color. Each node of this tree can be blocked or unblocked, all nodes are unblocked initially."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"simple path"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a path in a graph that does not have repeating nodes. The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"length"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a path is defined as the sum of weights of all edges on the path."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A path is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" when it is a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"simple path"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of edges of the same color $$$c$$$, all edges of color $$$c$$$ are on this path, and every node on the path is unblocked."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You need to operate $$$2$$$ kinds of queries: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" block a node, "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" unblock a node. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After each query, print the maximum "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"length"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" among all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" paths. If there are no "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" paths, print $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$, $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n,q \\leq 2\\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of nodes and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$n-1$$$ lines follow, each containing four integers $$$u$$$, $$$v$$$, $$$w$$$ and $$$c$$$ ($$$1 \\leq u,v,w,c \\leq n$$$; $$$u \\not = v$$$), denoting a weighted edge connecting node $$$u$$$ and node $$$v$$$ with weight $$$w$$$ and color $$$c$$$. It is guaranteed that these edges form a tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$q$$$ lines follow, each containing two integers $$$p$$$ and $$$x$$$ ($$$p = 0$$$ or $$$p = 1$$$, $$$1\\leq x\\leq n$$$), denoting a query: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$p = 0$$$, block the node $$$x$$$. It's guaranteed that it's not blocked at this time; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$p = 1$$$, unblock the node $$$x$$$. It's guaranteed that it's blocked at this time. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, print the maximum length of a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" path. If there are no "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" paths, print $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 4\n4 1 3 4\n5 2 4 4\n3 1 3 2\n1 2 5 1\n0 4\n0 3\n0 2\n1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n5\n0\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 5\n4 1 4 4\n4 5 2 2\n3 1 2 4\n3 2 3 1\n0 3\n0 4\n1 3\n1 4\n0 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n0\n3\n6\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6 9\n3 2 2 3\n2 4 4 2\n3 1 5 5\n6 4 3 2\n5 3 1 3\n0 2\n0 4\n0 5\n0 6\n1 2\n1 4\n1 5\n0 3\n1 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n5\n5\n5\n5\n5\n5\n0\n7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kin